/-! The SAME original q-cokernel at m=0 is the actual pushed-forward unit
of the literal projectiveIntersectionIdeal. Kernel, stalk exactness, sheaf
exactness and projection compatibility are proved internally. Ambient
transport uses the SAME canonical immersion and original structure maps.
STATUS: SOURCE ONLY / UNVERIFIED. No intrinsic H¹ transport or genus claim.
-/
noncomputable section
